sequenceDiagram
  actor R as Recepção / Totem
  participant J as Patient Journey
  participant K as Kafka
  participant T as Triage
  participant Q as Queue
  participant P as Presence
  participant N as Notification / Telão

  R->>J: criar/localizar visita e check-in
  J-->>K: patient-checked-in
  K-->>T: iniciar triagem
  T-->>K: clinical-priority-confirmed
  K-->>Q: criar entrada na fila
  Q-->>N: public view / chamada anonimizada

  R->>P: registrar saída temporária
  P-->>K: patient-presence-changed
  K-->>Q: aplicar return policy/readiness

  R->>P: registrar retorno
  P-->>K: patient-presence-changed
  K-->>Q: recalcular estado operacional

  Note over Q: prioridade clínica é preservada
